### Ledger API — run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request").
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Create account A
# @name accountA
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice" }

### Create account B
# @name accountB
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bob" }

### Attempt to set a balance (400)
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Eve", "balance": 1000000 }

###
@A = {{accountA.response.body.data.id}}
@B = {{accountB.response.body.data.id}}

### Credit 100 to A
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 100, "description": "Opening deposit", "reference_id": "INV-1" }

### Same reference again → 409 DUPLICATE_TRANSACTION
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 100, "reference_id": "INV-1" }

### Debit 30 from A
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 30, "description": "Groceries", "reference_id": "POS-1" }

### Overdraft → 422 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 1000, "reference_id": "POS-2" }

### Balance of A
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/balance

### History of A (all, latest first)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions

### History of A (credits only, page 1, 5 per page)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions?type=credit&page=1&limit=5

### Invalid pagination → 400
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions?page=0

### Transfer 20 from A to B
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from_account_id": "{{A}}", "to_account_id": "{{B}}", "amount": 20, "reference_id": "TRF-1" }

### Try to delete a transaction → 405 TRANSACTION_IMMUTABLE
DELETE {{base}}/accounts/{{A}}/transactions/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
